  # Define Color and Typography

  This is a code bundle for Define Color and Typography. The original project is available at https://www.figma.com/design/Q2J99QDO5JI8lqmNklKFVH/Define-Color-and-Typography.

  ## Running the code

  Run `npm i` to install the dependencies.

  Run `npm run dev` to start the development server.
  
